# Missing Images

The following images are imported in the code but were not found in the repository:

- hero-new.jpg
- work-1.jpg through work-6.jpg

These images must be provided by the site owner. Place them in this directory.
The files are tracked by the React app via `@/assets/` imports.

File requirements:
- Format: JPG / WebP
- hero-new.jpg: hero background, ~1920px wide
- work-1.jpg through work-6.jpg: gallery portfolio images, square aspect ratio recommended (~800x800px)
